  <note type="practice" source_type="Try It" title="Try It" number="8.110">
    <paragraph>Simplify: $$\frac{\frac{1}{x^{2}} - \frac{1}{y^{2}}}{\frac{1}{x} + \frac{1}{y}}.$$</paragraph>
